<title>POLAND: RAFAKO SIGNS $55 MLN CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>RAFAKO SIGNS $55 MLN CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA has signed an earlier announced $55-million contract to provide equipment to the Elektrownia Belchatow power station, Rafako said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Under the contract Rafako will provide desulphurisation equipment to the central Polish power station.</p>
<p>In July last year Rafako said it won a tender for the contract and said the work on the contract would last no more than 32 months.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
